        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Who started the Nobel Prize?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Alfred Nobel (1833–1896) was a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Swedish",
            "zh": "瑞典的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " scientist, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "inventor",
            "ref": "v-inventor"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and businessman. He invented "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "dynamite",
            "zh": "甘油炸药"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Alfred later felt sorry that his "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "invention",
            "ref": "v-invention"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " could kill people. Before he "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "passed away",
            "zh": "去世"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", he said he wanted his money to be used for "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "awards",
            "ref": "v-award"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " given in his name."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Who can get a Nobel Prize?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Nobel Prizes were first awarded in 1901, and they are still being awarded today. They are one of the most "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "respected",
            "ref": "v-respected"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " awards in the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Every year, the prizes are given to people for "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "outstanding",
            "zh": "杰出的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "achievements",
            "zh": "成就"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in six "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fields",
            "ref": "v-field"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": Physics, Chemistry, Physiology/Medicine, Literature, Economics and Peace. Famous winners include Albert Einstein, Mother Teresa, Barack Obama and more."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "level": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What do winners get?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Each Nobel Prize winner gets a gold medal, a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "diploma",
            "zh": "证书"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and a lot of money—about one million dollars!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
